Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.54,0:00:20.54,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"This episode contains explicit content that\Nmay be inappropriate for younger viewers."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.25,0:00:41.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Who is this frail but beautiful woman in\Nthe plaza of the Clock Village of Rostolf,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.75,0:00:47.21,Main,,0,0,0,,out of money and hungry,\Nwho looks like she's about to cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.21,0:00:49.42,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.42,0:00:52.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Sadly, it is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.67,0:01:05.00,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"A Deep Sorrow from the Past"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.63,0:01:10.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I need to make money somehow, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.67,0:01:13.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.50,0:01:19.08,Main,,0,0,0,,"Recruiting witch for ultra-short-term work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.08,0:01:21.88,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a chance to make a lot of money."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.13,0:01:26.67,Main,,0,0,0,,"If you are interested, please come\Nto the following address immediately."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.67,0:01:27.54,Main,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.54,0:01:34.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's see... it's from...\NThe Lavender Witch, Estelle?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:38.33,Main,,0,0,0,,So, Elaina, since you've come to see me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.33,0:01:41.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I can assume that you're willing to work, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.04,0:01:45.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I do want to make money.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.79,0:01:47.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you willing to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.29,0:01:51.54,Main,,0,0,0,,If possible, I'd like to make\Nmoney without working.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.54,0:01:56.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, well. Even if you're not\Nmotivated to work, a witch is a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.04,0:02:00.63,Main,,0,0,0,,So, you seem pretty young. How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.63,0:02:02.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be 18 this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.79,0:02:05.00,Main,,0,0,0,,When did you become a witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.00,0:02:06.83,Main,,0,0,0,,When I was 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.83,0:02:09.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, it was a year later than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.29,0:02:14.33,Main,,0,0,0,,How old were you when you\Nbecame an apprentice witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.33,0:02:16.08,Main,,0,0,0,,When I was ten, I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.08,0:02:19.46,Main,,0,0,0,,So you're saying it took you\Nthree years to become a witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.46,0:02:22.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I became a witch after one year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.13,0:02:24.46,Main,,0,0,0,,It took you two years longer, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.50,0:02:27.54,Main,,0,0,0,,How old are you right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:29.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Nineteen...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:32.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're a year older than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.13,0:02:36.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you making fun of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.79,0:02:39.25,Main,,0,0,0,,No, no, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.33,0:02:43.88,Main,,0,0,0,,So, what's the payment for the job?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.88,0:02:46.88,Main,,0,0,0,,You're more interested in the money\Nthan what the job actually is, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.88,0:02:50.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, let's talk about the payment first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.58,0:02:59.67,Main,,0,0,0,,That's contingent upon success.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.67,0:03:02.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Once my job is completed,\NI'll give you all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.46,0:03:03.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.83,0:03:06.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm very serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.42,0:03:12.04,Main,,0,0,0,,But, what kind of job do I need\Nto do to receive so much money?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.04,0:03:15.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm? Don't tell me you're getting nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.08,0:03:16.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.54,0:03:20.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I just want you to accompany me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.08,0:03:22.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Accompany you? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.83,0:03:27.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Before I tell you, do you know\Nabout the 2nd District Murderer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.92,0:03:29.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Second District Murderer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.92,0:03:32.29,Main,,0,0,0,,It sounds like a troubling matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.29,0:03:35.46,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a famous story that\Neveryone in this country knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.46,0:03:36.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.92,0:03:42.38,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a true story that\Neven has a play and a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.38,0:03:45.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Ten years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.63,0:03:49.25,Main,,0,0,0,,A robber went into the house of\Na wealthy family in the 2nd District.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.25,0:03:52.63,Main,,0,0,0,,The wealthy couple inside the house were killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.63,0:03:57.00,Main,,0,0,0,,but Selena, their only daughter,\Nwas out shopping and was safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.00,0:03:59.38,Main,,0,0,0,,The one bright spot of this tragedy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.38,0:04:01.46,Main,,0,0,0,,It wasn't, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.46,0:04:06.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Selena was taken in by her uncle,\Nbut she suffered horrible abuse,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.63,0:04:08.88,Main,,0,0,0,,and darkness grew in her heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.88,0:04:14.17,Main,,0,0,0,,making her hate people and the wretched world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.17,0:04:16.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Selena stabbed her uncle to death,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:18.71,Main,,0,0,0,,stabbing him over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.71,0:04:21.04,Main,,0,0,0,,And then she disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.04,0:04:23.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me, the girl, Selena--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.92,0:04:27.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. She's the 2nd District Murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.79,0:04:32.54,Main,,0,0,0,,She...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.54,0:04:35.54,Main,,0,0,0,,...was my childhood friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.54,0:04:40.17,Main,,0,0,0,,We were really close, like real sisters...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.46,0:04:47.96,Main,,0,0,0,,But I ended up going abroad to study magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.96,0:04:52.54,Main,,0,0,0,,And when I came back from\Nmy studies, Selena was already...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.54,0:04:54.88,Main,,0,0,0,,After discovering the pleasure of killing,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.88,0:04:58.00,Main,,0,0,0,,she continued on her spree,\Nkilling people one after another...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.00,0:05:02.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Three years ago, she was\Nfinally caught and executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.79,0:05:09.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I caught her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.08,0:05:12.75,Main,,0,0,0,,And I executed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.75,0:05:16.54,Main,,0,0,0,,With these hands, I cut off her head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:23.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I really wanted to save her...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.79,0:05:27.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanted to give her a chance\Nto atone for what she did...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.38,0:05:30.42,Main,,0,0,0,,But as someone working for the country,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.42,0:05:33.17,Main,,0,0,0,,the king's order was absolute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.63,0:05:35.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.75,0:05:37.25,Main,,0,0,0,,So then, Estelle,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.25,0:05:42.71,Main,,0,0,0,,what does that story have to do with\Nwhere you'd like me to accompany you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.71,0:05:45.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to save that girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.88,0:05:47.71,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I want you to come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.71,0:05:49.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Save?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.17,0:05:52.29,Main,,0,0,0,,You said she was executed\Nthree years ago, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.29,0:05:53.58,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.58,0:05:55.33,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why we need to go...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.33,0:05:57.21,Main,,0,0,0,,...to ten years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.92,0:06:06.75,Main,,0,0,0,,How do you plan on going back to ten years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.75,0:06:09.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Ever since the day I executed Selena,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.63,0:06:13.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been researching magic to go back in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.67,0:06:16.88,Main,,0,0,0,,In order to avoid that unhappy ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.88,0:06:20.21,Main,,0,0,0,,That girl was in this country ten years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.21,0:06:23.50,Main,,0,0,0,,That girl, back when she was\Nstill a decent human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.50,0:06:26.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to prevent the robber\Nfrom killing Selena's parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.83,0:06:31.17,Main,,0,0,0,,If I do that, I'm sure\NSelena's future will be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.17,0:06:33.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to do things over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.38,0:06:40.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't want to live in a world\Nwithout her in it anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.71,0:06:45.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I understand the situation now,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.54,0:06:47.63,Main,,0,0,0,,but I don't understand\Nhow you're planning to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.63,0:06:53.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if you are to go back in time,\Nwhy do you need my power?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.25,0:06:56.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.63,0:07:01.58,Main,,0,0,0,,The magic I created to go\Nback in time is not simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.58,0:07:05.21,Main,,0,0,0,,It wasn't something I could make\Nwithout sacrificing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.21,0:07:06.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Which means?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.46,0:07:07.88,Main,,0,0,0,,When they don't have enough magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.88,0:07:13.63,Main,,0,0,0,,mages can sacrifice something of\Nthemselves to create more magic, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.63,0:07:19.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes. I suppose that's true.\NLike their voice or memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.21,0:07:26.08,Main,,0,0,0,,What did you sacrifice in\Norder to complete your magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.08,0:07:28.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.33,0:07:32.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been letting out as much\Nof my blood as I could and storing it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.17,0:07:35.08,Main,,0,0,0,,and outside of that,\NI've been storing magic, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.08,0:07:37.21,Main,,0,0,0,,In order to travel back in time ten years,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.21,0:07:41.29,Main,,0,0,0,,you need an astounding amount of magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.42,0:07:45.92,Main,,0,0,0,,But, it's still not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.92,0:07:48.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I just need a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.04,0:07:50.75,Main,,0,0,0,,How much do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.75,0:07:55.92,Main,,0,0,0,,If I pour out all the magic\Ninside me, I'll have just enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.92,0:08:00.71,Main,,0,0,0,,In other words, once you travel back\Nin time, you won't have any magic left,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.71,0:08:05.67,Main,,0,0,0,,so you're bringing another witch along\Nto protect you in case anything happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.67,0:08:08.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.88,0:08:11.96,Main,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.96,0:08:16.08,Main,,0,0,0,,If we put these rings on,\Nthen we can share our magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.08,0:08:18.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Share our magic...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.71,0:08:23.17,Main,,0,0,0,,If I put this on, then\Neven if you have no magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.17,0:08:28.50,Main,,0,0,0,,you can use my power to do magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.50,0:08:30.29,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.29,0:08:31.25,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.25,0:08:33.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Will you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.04,0:08:39.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm a traveler...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.96,0:08:44.88,Main,,0,0,0,,...so I'm a little interested to see what\Nthis country was like ten years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.71,0:08:54.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.17,0:08:56.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, I'm going to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.67,0:09:04.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.17,0:09:06.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm fine. I'm just anemic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.79,0:09:08.13,Main,,0,0,0,,You're sweating, too, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.13,0:09:10.75,Main,,0,0,0,,That's because I'm anemic, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.75,0:09:12.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't seem fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.50,0:09:13.96,Main,,0,0,0,,But I'm still going to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.96,0:09:17.92,Main,,0,0,0,,If I don't do it when I can,\Nthen I'll lose my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.92,0:09:20.38,Main,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.38,0:09:22.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll ask again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.21,0:09:23.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.42,0:09:26.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Are {\i1}you {\i0}ready, Estelle?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.04,0:09:27.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm totally ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.42,0:09:30.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been ready for years!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.17,0:09:53.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.21,0:09:54.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I forgot to tell you something!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.96,0:09:56.83,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.46,0:10:00.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.96,0:10:05.38,Main,,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.63,0:10:26.46,Main,,0,0,0,,It looks like it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.38,0:10:35.92,Main,,0,0,0,,The date is from ten years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.92,0:10:39.58,Main,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe,\Nbut it looks like it did work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.75,0:10:41.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.96,0:10:43.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Our time limit is one hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.83,0:10:48.33,Main,,0,0,0,,When the clock strikes six,\Nwe'll be brought back to our own time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.33,0:10:50.67,Main,,0,0,0,,We only have one hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.67,0:10:53.29,Main,,0,0,0,,That was all I could manage with my magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.29,0:10:54.88,Main,,0,0,0,,But,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.88,0:10:56.04,Main,,0,0,0,,it's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.04,0:10:57.96,Main,,0,0,0,,If we've got that much time,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.96,0:11:02.42,Main,,0,0,0,,it'll be easy to make it so the\Nnext ten years never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.92,0:11:05.63,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.63,0:11:07.13,Main,,0,0,0,,In about twenty minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.13,0:11:10.96,Main,,0,0,0,,a robber wearing a black hood\Nwill break into Selena's house,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.96,0:11:13.29,Main,,0,0,0,,and stab her parents repeatedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.29,0:11:16.29,Main,,0,0,0,,So we'll get her parents\Nout before that happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.29,0:11:18.71,Main,,0,0,0,,ambush the robber, and drive the robber away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.71,0:11:19.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Easy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.92,0:11:21.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I hope everything goes according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.75,0:11:23.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.58,0:11:25.04,Main,,0,0,0,,If her parents live,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.04,0:11:28.00,Main,,0,0,0,,then I'm sure Selena's life\Nwould not take the turn it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.00,0:11:29.54,Main,,0,0,0,,If that's the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.54,0:11:35.00,Main,,0,0,0,,then the ten-years-later Rostolf\Nwe return to will be very different.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.00,0:11:37.21,Main,,0,0,0,,That won't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.21,0:11:39.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Just because we meddled in the past
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.33,0:11:42.58,Main,,0,0,0,,won't change the fact that\NI killed Selena in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.58,0:11:44.54,Main,,0,0,0,,In other words,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.54,0:11:48.08,Main,,0,0,0,,the world we will return to is\Nthe world that was already there,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.08,0:11:50.63,Main,,0,0,0,,but the world without the murderer
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.63,0:11:54.46,Main,,0,0,0,,will exist on a completely different time axis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:59.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, I don't mean to be rude,\Nbut is there any point in that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.17,0:12:01.04,Main,,0,0,0,,That really {\i1}is {\i0}rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.04,0:12:06.21,Main,,0,0,0,,In our world, Selena will\Nstill have been executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.21,0:12:08.25,Main,,0,0,0,,There {\i1}is {\i0}a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.25,0:12:11.21,Main,,0,0,0,,By doing this, it makes {\i1}me {\i0}feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.21,0:12:17.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Just thinking that there's a future\Nwhere she was saved is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:19.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that how it works?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.58,0:12:21.83,Main,,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.88,0:12:28.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey, w-wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.21,0:12:29.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Selena!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.79,0:12:36.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Selena!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.75,0:12:40.79,Main,,0,0,0,,H-Huh? Miss? Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.79,0:12:43.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I couldn't save you this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.75,0:12:46.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so, so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.46,0:12:49.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, Miss, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.38,0:12:53.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll definitely, definitely save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.54,0:12:58.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this, like, a new way of proselytizing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.42,0:13:00.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I was acting suspicious, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.75,0:13:01.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.63,0:13:03.67,Main,,0,0,0,,You still are, in a present progressive sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.67,0:13:05.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I really am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.58,0:13:07.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to hug you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.71,0:13:10.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you, like, a new kind\Nof pervert or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.08,0:13:13.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I came here from the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.71,0:13:16.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm in the middle of my shopping, so I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.54,0:13:17.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Please excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.67,0:13:20.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Right, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.67,0:13:24.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Selena.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.88,0:13:28.33,Main,,0,0,0,,It looks like you were treated very coldly...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.33,0:13:31.21,Main,,0,0,0,,She's always been like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.21,0:13:34.25,Main,,0,0,0,,But you know, even though she talks like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.25,0:13:37.00,Main,,0,0,0,,inside, she's really kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.00,0:13:39.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.71,0:13:45.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.08,0:13:47.33,Main,,0,0,0,,It's time to get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.71,0:13:51.38,Main,,0,0,0,,You're Estelle's older half-sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.38,0:13:55.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't know she had a half sister.\NBut you do look a lot like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.04,0:14:00.58,Main,,0,0,0,,That's true. The nape and line of\Nyour neck are the same as Estelle's.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.58,0:14:01.79,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.79,0:14:03.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.42,0:14:04.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it really okay not to?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.63,0:14:06.21,Main,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.21,0:14:09.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, this is a message from my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.21,0:14:13.21,Main,,0,0,0,,He wants to talk to you about something\Nimportant that happened to Estelle
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.21,0:14:16.13,Main,,0,0,0,,during her study abroad, so he asks\Nthat you please come with me immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.13,0:14:18.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what's going on...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.08,0:14:20.58,Main,,0,0,0,,But, well, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.58,0:14:23.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you. This way please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.46,0:14:28.63,Main,,0,0,0,,It really worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.63,0:14:33.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Estelle just needs to come back and\Nthen all that's left is to wait for the robber.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.50,0:14:37.96,Main,,0,0,0,,In a few minutes,\Na black-hooded robber will appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.92,0:14:49.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't it taking a long time?\NFor Estelle and the robber...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.00,0:14:51.17,Main,,0,0,0,,...and stab her parents repeatedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.17,0:14:53.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Stab repeatedly, huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.21,0:14:57.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Would someone really go that far in a robbery?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.13,0:14:59.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Could it have been a crime\Ncommitted because of a grudge
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.38,0:15:02.79,Main,,0,0,0,,that was made to look like a robbery?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.54,0:15:10.17,Main,,0,0,0,,My magic's being sucked out of the ring...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.17,0:15:14.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Which means, Estelle is fighting someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.54,0:15:17.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Her opponent is probably the robber.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.79,0:15:26.88,Main,,0,0,0,,But a blade can't beat an\Nopponent who can use magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.88,0:15:32.96,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a pain, so I hope everything's\Nsettled by the time I get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.75,0:15:40.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it over...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.58,0:15:55.50,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.50,0:15:59.79,Main,,0,0,0,,We... Estelle, and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.79,0:16:05.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Everything we imagined...\Neverything we assumed... was wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.33,0:16:19.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Miss, you were with this lady earlier, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.21,0:16:23.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no... What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.38,0:16:26.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll kill you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.25,0:16:28.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Why did you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.63,0:16:32.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I was abused by my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.96,0:16:35.04,Main,,0,0,0,,My dad did perverted things to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.04,0:16:37.33,Main,,0,0,0,,and my jealous mom hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.33,0:16:41.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Despite that, we pretended to be a happy family,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.46,0:16:43.38,Main,,0,0,0,,but it was a broken home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.38,0:16:45.50,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.50,0:16:47.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'll be forgiven?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.42,0:16:49.25,Main,,0,0,0,,O-Of course no--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.25,0:16:51.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I was so surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.17,0:16:55.75,Main,,0,0,0,,You two came just in time\Nto get in the way of my plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.75,0:16:58.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you really come from the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.42,0:16:59.67,Main,,0,0,0,,We...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.67,0:17:04.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, if you really came from the future,\Nthen will you tell me something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.75,0:17:07.63,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the future me doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.00,0:17:11.21,Main,,0,0,0,,You are killed by your best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.21,0:17:14.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Killed? By my best friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.21,0:17:17.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't have a best friend, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.08,0:17:21.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.08,0:17:23.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.42,0:17:25.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I get it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.67,0:17:29.17,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the future Estelle, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.79,0:17:33.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.04,0:17:34.88,Main,,0,0,0,,But why does Estelle kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.88,0:17:37.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.21,0:17:40.33,Main,,0,0,0,,...you become a murderer...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.33,0:17:43.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. A murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.04,0:17:44.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. That makes sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.71,0:17:45.88,Main,,0,0,0,,It makes sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.88,0:17:46.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.88,0:17:49.88,Main,,0,0,0,,...killing people...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.88,0:17:54.29,Main,,0,0,0,,...is {\i1}so {\i0}much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.71,0:18:06.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.50,0:18:11.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.92,0:18:13.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You were still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.50,0:18:15.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I should've stabbed you mor--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.75,0:18:24.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Selena...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.00,0:18:27.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Ow! Ouch! That hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.63,0:18:30.83,Main,,0,0,0,,You were tricking me the whole time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.83,0:18:33.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought we were friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.75,0:18:37.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Estelle's trying to kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.96,0:18:42.04,Main,,0,0,0,,And when I become a murderer, Estelle will--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.04,0:18:44.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought we were friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.21,0:18:47.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought you could go\Nback to being a good girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.50,0:18:51.25,Main,,0,0,0,,The whole time! You were tricking me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.25,0:18:53.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.63,0:18:58.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Ow! Ow, ow, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.17,0:18:59.25,Main,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.25,0:19:01.13,Main,,0,0,0,,...demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.92,0:19:08.04,Main,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.04,0:19:10.79,Main,,0,0,0,,...murderer...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.29,0:19:15.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Estelle, please, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.08,0:19:16.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.17,0:19:19.00,Main,,0,0,0,,This... This...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.00,0:19:21.00,Main,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.29,0:19:31.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Please come off...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.75,0:19:42.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't need my memories of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.58,0:19:44.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't need any of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.83,0:19:49.04,Main,,0,0,0,,They can all disappear, along with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.71,0:19:55.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.58,0:19:59.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have thought\Nback on our time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.67,0:20:02.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have felt sorry about your death.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.96,0:20:05.75,Main,,0,0,0,,You should just die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.75,0:20:11.21,Main,,0,0,0,,You should...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.75,0:20:16.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Selena.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.00,0:20:40.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Estelle?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.04,0:20:42.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Elaina, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.63,0:20:46.25,Main,,0,0,0,,What did I...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.25,0:20:47.63,Main,,0,0,0,,This is...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.63,0:20:49.75,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.75,0:20:52.04,Main,,0,0,0,,About Selena?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.17,0:20:55.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.42,0:20:59.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You sacrificed your\Nmemories for magical power...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.50,0:21:04.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Who was that person to me...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.08,0:21:09.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it. It doesn't matter anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.46,0:21:12.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.96,0:21:29.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I couldn't stop her...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.46,0:21:32.96,Main,,0,0,0,,She... with her own hands...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.96,0:21:35.83,Main,,0,0,0,,...killed her best friend twice...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.79,0:21:47.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm just an ordinary traveler.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.13,0:21:49.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Just an ordinary witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.46,0:21:54.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Inexperienced...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.88,0:22:00.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Unable to do anything...
